BT /F1 9 Tf 72 728 Td 12 TL
(POPULATION SERVED | STANDARD SITES | REDUCED SITES.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Row 1: population greater than 100,000 | standard 100 sites | reduced 50 sites.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Row 2: population 10,001 to 100,000 | standard 60 sites | reduced 30 sites.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Row 3: population 3,301 to 10,000 | standard 40 sites | reduced 20 sites.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Row 4: population 501 to 3,300 | standard 20 sites | reduced 10 sites.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Row 5: population 101 to 500 | standard 10 sites | reduced 5 sites.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Row 6: population 100 or fewer | standard 5 sites | reduced 5 sites.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Use the standard column unless a valid reduction approval covering the period is on file, in) Tj T*
(which case use the reduced column for that period. A population change mid-record moves the) Tj T*
(system to the row matching the population served in that period.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
