BT /F1 13 Tf 72 750 Td 15 TL (40 CFR 141.86\(e\) - invalid sample results \(excerpt\)) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 728 Td 12 TL
(\(e\) Invalid sample results. The State may invalidate a sample result for cause, including) Tj T*
(sampling error, laboratory error, or a documented data quality objection. A result) Tj T*
(invalidated under this paragraph is not included in the determination of the 90th percentile) Tj T*
(under 141.80\(c\)\(3\).) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A result the system itself marks invalid is not excluded on that mark alone. The exclusion) Tj T*
(takes effect only where the State has approved the invalidation for that sample. The) Tj T*
(approval record carries the sample identifier, the approval type, and the dates that bound) Tj T*
(the approval. The collection date of the sample must fall on or after the effective date and) Tj T*
(on or before the expiry date of the approval.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(A result flagged invalid without a matching approved invalidation is used exactly as) Tj T*
(reported, including where the reported value is the highest in the set. Systems therefore) Tj T*
(receive no credit for self reported invalidation.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
endobj
