BT /F1 13 Tf 72 750 Td 15 TL (Office guidance - reduced monitoring frequency and worked example) Tj ET
BT /F1 9 Tf 72 728 Td 12 TL
(40 CFR 141.86\(d\) permits the State to reduce the number of samples a system collects where) Tj T*
(the system holds a current reduction approval and has demonstrated a stable record. This) Tj T*
(office adopts the following convention, which controls over the general expectation that) Tj T*
(reduced monitoring follows a clean record.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Office convention for an annual reduction. Where an annual reduction approval covers the) Tj T*
(monitoring period, the schedule is REDUCED_ANNUAL when the period carries no exceedance, the) Tj T*
(required minimum count is met, and at least one of the two preceding periods in the system) Tj T*
(record carries an exceedance. The excursion is the justification for the reduction, not the) Tj T*
(obstacle to it. A system with annual approval and no exceedance in the preceding two periods) Tj T*
(takes STANDARD_SEMIANNUAL.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Office convention for a triennial reduction. Where a triennial reduction approval covers the) Tj T*
(monitoring period, the schedule is REDUCED_TRIENNIAL when the period carries no exceedance,) Tj T*
(the required minimum count is met, and neither the current period nor either of the two) Tj T*
(preceding periods carries an exceedance. Where an annual approval and a triennial approval) Tj T*
(both cover the same period and the triennial conditions are met, the triennial result) Tj T*
(controls.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
(Worked example. A system at 600 population served holds an annual reduction approval) Tj T*
(effective 1 March 2024. Its lead 90th percentile is 0.0130 mg/L in January 2024, above the) Tj T*
(action level, and 0.0036 mg/L in February 2024. In March 2024 the lead 90th percentile is) Tj T*
(0.0036 mg/L and ten samples are on file against a reduced minimum of ten. The two preceding) Tj T*
(periods include one exceedance, so the March schedule is REDUCED_ANNUAL. Had the January) Tj T*
(result been at or below the action level, no preceding exceedance would exist and the March) Tj T*
(schedule would be STANDARD_SEMIANNUAL.) Tj T*
() Tj T*
ET
endstream
